//     and HLV/HSV access faults from M, HS, U, VS and VU (as applicable), with MPV and GVA preset
//     to the opposite of their expected values.
//   2. Check MPV, MPP, MPIE = old MIE (from M-mode; MIE = 0 always), GVA, mepc, mcause, mtval,
//     mtval2 = 0 and mtinst legal.
//   3. hstatus.SPV/SPVP/GVA and sepc keep values written before the traps.
//
